[I] EvIE extension headers

[T] evieext contains the protocol headers for the X11 Extended Visual
[T] Information (EVI) extension. EVI allows clients to query extra
[T] information about the visuals supported by an X server, such as overlay
[T] planes.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/proto/evieproto

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
